---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact" description="Get in touch with Corbin Riches about research, engineering, collaborations, or something on this site.">
	<section class="page-header">
		<p class="eyebrow">contact</p>
		<h1>Say hello.</h1>
		<p>If you are working on research, engineering, or another technical project that you think overlaps with my interests, feel free to reach out. I am always happy to hear about interesting work, possible collaborations, or simply talk with people working on similar problems.</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section contact-grid">
		<article class="project-card">
			<p class="eyebrow">email</p>
			<h2><a href="mailto:corbin@corbinriches.com">corbin@corbinriches.com</a></h2>
			<p>Researchers, scientists, engineers, students, and curious people are welcome. If something on this website caught your attention, I would be happy to talk about that too.</p>
		</article>
	</section>
</Layout>
